INFO 2026-04-14 00:47:29,555 accounts.api_io [request_id=4463D00D-CB25-47D9-A771-EC335E38D97F] HTTP 请求进入: POST /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/push/ headers={"Host": "172.20.10.2:8000", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept-Encoding": "gzip, deflate", "User-Agent": "SparkClient/1 CFNetwork/3860.400.51 Darwin/25.3.0", "Connection": "keep-alive", "Accept": "*/*", "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh-Hans;q=0.9", "Authorization": "Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzc2MTI5MzE4LCJpYXQiOjE3NzYxMjc1MTgsImp0aSI6Ijc2OWNmYzZiYmIxMjQ0NGI4YWQ2OTU3NTZlMDZiOTcyIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjEifQ.YZR_rlMnr5EaAc0kLFXbNpzfCvB2oGUCjFJpABewqQs", "X-Request-Id": "4463D00D-CB25-47D9-A771-EC335E38D97F", "Content-Length": "3360"} body={"messages": [{"role": "user", "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "kind": "text", "client_message_id": "EA2C0BAD-A646-4071-9111-AF59BFD0C1AF", "tombstone": false, "content": "刚刚", "thread_id": "A9B00666-7DD4-4E25-85F8-E6E345F42ABE", "delivery_state": "pending", "created_at": "2026-04-13T16:17:13.259Z", "attachments": []}, {"role": "user", "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "kind": "text", "client_message_id": "18D38235-D7C8-46BE-8ECE-7EA5DCC7C0D9", "tombstone": false, "content": "帮我创建知识库  医疗知识", "thread_id": "D4E5F3D9-2992-4170-8B32-4FF185CB7B24", "delivery_state": "pending", "created_at": "2026-04-14T00:47:22.201Z", "attachments": []}, {"role": "assistant", "reasoning_expanded": false, "reasoning_visibility": "full", "kind": "text", "client_message_id": "5469FD6C-6633-4E37-BEB9-1408628C68E8", "tombstone": false, "content": "已为您创建医疗知识库，包含以下核心内容：\n\n**1. 口腔健康**\n- **诊断**：阻生牙（38/48近中低位阻生）\n- **状态**：远中牙龈覆盖，龈红肿\n- **建议**：择期拔除阻生牙（已于苏州大学附属第四医院初诊）\n\n**2. 消化系统**\n- **诊断**：慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴胆汁反流\n- **表现**：胃镜显示胃体见胆汁残留\n- **建议**：遵医嘱治疗，注意饮食规律\n\n**3. 心脏健康**\n- **诊断**：窦性心动过缓\n- **建议**：无症状通常无需治疗，但需定期监测心率，如出现心排血量不足症状及时就医\n\n**4. 甲状腺**\n- **诊断**：甲状腺囊肿（多发）\n- **建议**：专科治疗，定期复查\n\n**5. 血液指标异常**\n- **异常项**：中性粒细胞百分数降低、淋巴细胞百分数增高、血小板压积及计数增高\n- **建议**：及时复查，如持续异常请尽早去医院查明原因\n\n所有信息已安全存储于您的个人知识库。如有需要复查或调整治疗方案，可随时联系医生。", "thread_id": "D4E5F3D9-2992-4170-8B32-4FF185CB7B24", "delivery_state": "pending", "created_at": "2026-04-14T00:47:29.646Z", "attachments": [{"type": "toolName", "text": "save_memory", "id": "66CA5B86-746B-4EDE-9664-51D3AFFEA3D5"}, {"type": "toolContent", "text": "[1] save_memory\n记忆已保存：医疗知识库-口腔疾病：阻生牙（38/48\n\n[2] save_memory\n记忆已保存：医疗知识库-消化系统：慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴\n\n[3] save_memory\n记忆已保存：医疗知识库-心脏健康：窦性心动过缓，无症\n\n[4] save_memory\n记忆已保存：医疗知识库-甲状腺：甲状腺囊肿（多发），\n\n[5] save_memory\n记忆已保存：医疗知识库-血液检查：中性粒细胞百分数降", "id": "CDF3B420-7F72-4A29-B9F9-917F0A027B81"}, {"type": "operationalState", "text": "正在使用工具：save_memory", "id": "B5B58284-A646-47A4-B998-170968F13237"}, {"type": "operationalDescription", "text": "记忆已保存：医疗知识库-口腔疾病：阻生牙（38/48\n[2] save_memory\n记忆已保存：医疗知识库-消化系统：慢性非萎缩性胃炎伴\n[3] save_memory\n记忆已保存：医疗知识库-心脏健康：窦性心动过缓，无症\n[4] save_memory\n记忆已保存：医疗知识库-甲状腺：甲状腺囊肿（多发），\n[5] save_memory\n记忆已保存：医疗知识库-血液检查：中性粒细胞百分数降", "id": "61EB7E5A-2874-4DF7-A466-522207DE3233"}]}]}
