INFO 2026-04-14 00:53:40,273 accounts.api_io [request_id=C813524E-AED7-4FA0-806A-FEE9F3A7DEC1] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=4 bytes=3491 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMDRUMTQ6Mzc6MjUuODgyMTk4KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI2NDMifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "362c67a0-8eed-4a1d-8876-558d0a64d83f", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好 你会做什么", "client_message_id": "6f9379c4-398b-4784-b83b-026d89b60382", "server_message_id": "e1f9d194-f4df-4c68-bd49-567bb6c12052", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T14:36:20.966000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T14:36:50.077737+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "362c67a0-8eed-4a1d-8876-558d0a64d83f", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我是Spark健康助手，可以为你提供这些实用健康相关的帮助哦：\n1. 日常健康指导：比如不同人群的膳食搭配、科学运动方案、作息调整建议、四季养生技巧等，帮你养成健康的生活习惯。\n2. 轻症应对建议：像感冒、落枕、轻微腹泻、晕车、蚊虫叮咬等常见小不适的居家缓解方法，还有常用药的使用注意事项科普。\n3. 健康避坑科普：帮你辨别「食物相克」「输液通血管」这类常见健康谣言，避开养生误区。\n4. 慢病护理参考：给高血压、糖尿病、高血脂等常见慢病患者提供日常监测、饮食禁忌、居家护理的参考建议。\n\n⚠️ 注意：我的所有建议都仅供健康参考，不能替代执业医师的当面诊断和治疗，如果有不明原因的剧痛、重症、急症，请第一时间前往医院就诊哦。", "client_message_id": "20112ff9-a40d-44d2-a941-a2042ff61b39", "server_message_id": "71b97cc0-6230-4d5e-a3d2-30b306ace85c", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T14:36:50.077000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T14:36:50.092432+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "362c67a0-8eed-4a1d-8876-558d0a64d83f", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你会使用工具吗？", "client_message_id": "c0072318-5d2e-43c2-b7e2-2cc8006dcbdd", "server_message_id": "c95430b6-3bf6-4aa8-a989-a688d0d9edef", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T14:37:07.380000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T14:37:25.874850+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "362c67a0-8eed-4a1d-8876-558d0a64d83f", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我目前暂时无法调用外部实时工具哦~不过我内置了经过专业审核的健康、医学相关知识库，能够满足大部分日常健康咨询需求，比如常见轻症居家缓解方法、不同人群膳食搭配指导、健康谣言辨别、慢病日常护理建议等，你有相关需求都可以直接说明。\n\n⚠️ 我的所有建议仅供参考，不能替代执业医师的当面诊断，如有急症、重症请第一时间就医哦。", "client_message_id": "ea30f5c5-296f-4f58-8dd1-f9febd11ee90", "server_message_id": "0776666f-ed96-49d0-9594-60662ec5144d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T14:37:25.808000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T14:37:25.882198+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
