INFO 2026-04-14 00:53:40,346 accounts.api_io [request_id=2F73B771-CBA0-4BAA-BBB7-CA5E1A182C89] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=3 bytes=4439 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMDRUMTU6NTU6NTcuNTE4MzM4KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI2NjAifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "ebe83898-f97a-4df5-82ab-7473a0faefc1", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "ni", "client_message_id": "a0b1d28b-4ad7-443a-88c3-82646adfadad", "server_message_id": "79764719-9611-4457-8a30-1fd110e33026", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:47:39.150000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:47:46.082764+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "ebe83898-f97a-4df5-82ab-7473a0faefc1", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "Hi there! I'm your Spark Health Assistant. Feel free to share any health-related questions, needs such as fitness planning, diet advice, sleep/activity data query, medical record management, etc. I'm here to help you with accurate and actionable guidance.", "client_message_id": "58e8cd28-1719-4c64-9072-149f22673015", "server_message_id": "ee96198c-5eca-4ee3-af38-a82d1306369c", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:47:46.148000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:47:46.091788+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "ebe83898-f97a-4df5-82ab-7473a0faefc1", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你会做什么", "client_message_id": "4f136dde-1294-4057-b8b4-f0189ec01156", "server_message_id": "14e7290a-cc2a-4c6c-8356-152b591f6ff3", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:47:54.248000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:48:09.395116+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "ebe83898-f97a-4df5-82ab-7473a0faefc1", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我是专注于健康领域的智能助手，可以为你提供这些服务哦：\n1. **健康数据查询分析**：帮你调取/分析步数、热量消耗、睡眠记录、运动健身记录、营养摄入等健康数据，给出针对性的优化建议\n2. **饮食营养指导**：分析饮食结构、计算摄入热量/营养素，生成营养记录卡，定制膳食建议\n3. **运动健身支持**：制定运动计划、评估运动效果，结合消耗/摄入数据给出运动调整方案\n4. **睡眠健康管理**：查询睡眠周期数据、分析睡眠质量，提供改善睡眠的实用方法\n5. **医疗健康服务**：管理体检报告、病历、用药记录，查询健康档案，解答常见健康疑问、科普靠谱健康知识\n6. **实用辅助工具**：设置用药/体检提醒、查询附近医疗场所、规划出行路线、管理你的健康专属知识库等\n\n你现在有什么具体需求呀？", "client_message_id": "2d191dac-756c-4ceb-9ede-0c322d0052a9", "server_message_id": "e93bd7df-61b9-4988-acaa-47d763fa0267", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:48:09.466000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:48:09.402488+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "ebe83898-f97a-4df5-82ab-7473a0faefc1", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "哈哈哈   吧", "client_message_id": "f49cc76d-4121-4f49-bc88-becc08067267", "server_message_id": "dd772ecc-7d02-473b-a255-c48c1d633a8d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:55:52.487000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:55:57.509662+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "ebe83898-f97a-4df5-82ab-7473a0faefc1", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "😄 要是你之后有健康相关的问题，或者需要查运动、饮食、睡眠数据，或者要设置健康提醒之类的，随时和我说就好哦~", "client_message_id": "364c8cdc-01f5-4dfc-92c2-921b36039151", "server_message_id": "19157f37-2424-43a9-8335-81b896dd2371", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T15:55:57.487000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T15:55:57.518338+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
