INFO 2026-04-14 00:53:40,395 accounts.api_io [request_id=A08C6057-0A34-4540-A6B8-E6ADB529B308] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=3 bytes=9133 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMDRUMjI6Mjk6MTEuNTIwNzk5KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI2NzcifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "ad119b1c-34df-4c47-89a0-a0a1c436aa70", "server_message_id": "5a710698-c7cc-4823-b464-1a1208965ab5", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:22:33.458000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:22:40.291794+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好😊！我是你的专属健康助手，不管是想查询运动、饮食、睡眠等健康数据，还是有健康相关的疑问、需要制定健康计划，都可以告诉我哦~", "client_message_id": "80668f62-39d9-4847-96e7-9f78d9d8526e", "server_message_id": "90fc2bfa-466e-42ce-8b30-3b67a78b3658", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:22:40.239000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:22:40.303868+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你会做什么", "client_message_id": "ac6fc050-b4a8-4339-9735-8fe4ad71e179", "server_message_id": "3cc6a818-daff-4515-9b6c-5d2511f0a17a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:24:36.333000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:24:55.743017+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我能帮你搞定多类健康相关的需求哦：\n1. 📊 健康数据查询分析：可查询/统计你的步数、热量消耗、饮食营养摄入、睡眠质量、运动记录等数据，支持摄入消耗对比、健康度分析，还能生成营养卡片、健康报告。\n2. 🩺 健康管理服务：帮你分析饮食/运动/睡眠结构、给出个性化优化建议，支持记录用药、病历、检查报告，生成结构化健康卡片、整理专属健康档案，需要解读体检报告、药盒、皮肤状态时也可以引导你上传图片识别。\n3. 📅 实用工具支持：可以设置健康相关的提醒（吃药、运动、体检等）、查询天气、规划出行路线、搜索周边适合的运动/健康餐饮场所等。\n4. 📚 健康知识查询：可检索健康相关的科普、专业文献，还能帮你整理健康笔记、保存重要健康信息。\n\n有具体需求随时告诉我就好~", "client_message_id": "0fc0cd8d-2c18-4439-b4e3-7bbf8d0c6a89", "server_message_id": "ca222406-dc57-4da3-aa4d-b60a98a80431", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:24:55.715000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:24:55.756243+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "运动记录呀查询", "client_message_id": "5d0d6a40-1038-49d0-b0ba-a0c633b43c02", "server_message_id": "294eeec5-cb6e-4030-8e03-aa874d9f6ee6", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:25:04.045000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:25:11.508391+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "没问题呀，请告诉我你想要查询运动记录的时间段哦，需要提供开始日期和结束日期（格式例如2024-05-01），另外如果需要筛选跑步、步行、骑行这类特定运动类型也可以告诉我~", "client_message_id": "c24059cc-ba3b-4178-9733-c2a2d0e9e7ee", "server_message_id": "14b775e1-e32a-4a7b-a7dc-457c6b0b3062", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:25:11.480000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:25:11.519876+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "20260404查询运动记录", "client_message_id": "4a0b08e9-12e4-4bb0-b01e-bf0ba7af285b", "server_message_id": "a6260457-fa83-489c-b344-1f3c60fa7f22", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:25:34.943000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:25:43.911361+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你提供的2026-04-04是未来日期哦，运动记录仅支持查询不晚于今日的历史数据，请你核对日期后，提供正确的开始和结束日期（格式如2024-04-04），我会帮你查询相关记录~", "client_message_id": "adc659df-b3e1-4e1c-b084-8940f67f0913", "server_message_id": "d7c160d4-ead2-4117-bccc-6e0ff2acc329", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:25:43.883000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:25:43.922313+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "今天日期是？", "client_message_id": "cc51554a-3ec8-4d57-afd3-e53beaa88b90", "server_message_id": "feb06d38-3aa7-4420-a4bb-74527a187b3d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:26:04.277000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:26:37.837903+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "抱歉我暂时无法联网获取实时日期哦，你可以查看你设备上显示的今日日期，查询运动记录时提供的时间段只要不晚于你那边的今日日期就可以啦😉", "client_message_id": "c378a6ef-d551-4070-958a-35fcdd6aea95", "server_message_id": "06840e51-259d-49c9-b589-43fee71c521a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:26:37.816000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:26:37.851868+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "帮我查下今天的运动记录呀", "client_message_id": "c37a9f16-ad1f-43af-939b-6ee4d3c087c2", "server_message_id": "94ec2286-7861-4658-9f5a-0d566b53be5f", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:26:41.762000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:27:01.845047+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "麻烦你告知我今天的具体日期哦，格式为yyyy-MM-dd，我就可以马上帮你查询今日的运动记录啦~", "client_message_id": "f1eeb737-ad0a-42b1-9c69-a8d4cdc864a5", "server_message_id": "bebeb6c9-f33d-4e20-8959-6c58d25b696a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:27:01.811000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:27:01.857386+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "什么", "client_message_id": "c4ec03c7-bd10-43fb-9335-183a5d90bcc4", "server_message_id": "dab19c1a-8310-4c5d-b67a-cccddd4a1b2e", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:29:04.346000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:29:11.506999+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "64fa8dea-9441-40b4-8298-d87e9862af74", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我没办法自动获取你当前的实时日期哦，你告诉我今天的具体日期（格式参考：2024-06-15），我就能马上帮你查询今日的运动记录啦~", "client_message_id": "bf041b72-3ff7-471f-9d16-e731e5f77886", "server_message_id": "9d6809d9-53f3-4ce6-919a-d6a790aea5a3", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-04T22:29:11.491000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-04T22:29:11.520799+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
