INFO 2026-04-14 00:53:40,436 accounts.api_io [request_id=9570E011-0357-47EA-99A2-BF7DC62FA8CE] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=5 bytes=3098 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMDVUMDI6NDI6MTEuNTY1ODUyKzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI2ODQifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "16fe711c-b8aa-4bba-9c6b-4a47ac2b7653", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀😊 我是Spark健康助手，如果你有健康相关的疑问，比如饮食运动建议、常见疾病护理、日常健康科普等，都可以随时告诉我哦！", "client_message_id": "d2a79dab-153a-45b0-9c67-c37259b7998f", "server_message_id": "ec4baa5b-82d8-4737-a0ee-f4306cfc540d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T02:19:16.359000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T02:21:00.658907+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "16fe711c-b8aa-4bba-9c6b-4a47ac2b7653", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "14c0b007-ca47-4961-9b3a-177cf2df204b", "server_message_id": "90595a91-7f92-494f-90ce-cda786f14c23", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T02:21:05.021000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T02:21:10.284654+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "16fe711c-b8aa-4bba-9c6b-4a47ac2b7653", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "又见面啦😉 还是有健康相关的问题想要咨询吗？不管是日常饮食运动建议、常见小问题护理还是健康科普都可以告诉我哦！", "client_message_id": "4fcc9b00-ff13-4e5d-9092-973fcccc20c6", "server_message_id": "287cac85-38d5-438a-af88-f500d7771b2c", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T02:21:10.044000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T02:21:10.297585+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duratio