INFO 2026-04-14 00:53:40,519 accounts.api_io [request_id=85F2D19C-AFDC-47CD-803B-CE6141A331E9] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=3 bytes=6906 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMDVUMDM6NDM6MDEuNDMyODY5KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI3MTgifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "2bd886a1-9105-48e4-95cc-92c6ce350752", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "8752b253-fe9c-4574-8664-06fc0116aa1e", "server_message_id": "33b21de5-8a7d-48a9-8702-6d5916cbe80d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:41:06.964000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:41:14.346371+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "2bd886a1-9105-48e4-95cc-92c6ce350752", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀😊我是你的专属健康助手，你可以向我咨询健康相关问题，比如饮食/运动建议、健康报告解读、日程提醒、查看历史健康数据等，有什么我可以帮你的吗？", "client_message_id": "1efa7699-5763-404b-8edc-7dc8f2dd0774", "server_message_id": "b7922dc3-58b5-4e8f-b390-234c076d0e8a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:41:14.290000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:41:14.362653+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "2bd886a1-9105-48e4-95cc-92c6ce350752", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "给我输出图书馆的历史 现状 和未来 发展", "client_message_id": "c8d19f94-592a-4036-80ae-15879f54faa2", "server_message_id": "5a69beb7-8761-4232-9393-d4398dd1c305", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:41:20.640000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:42:00.030424+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "2bd886a1-9105-48e4-95cc-92c6ce350752", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我整理了图书馆的发展脉络、当前特征和未来趋势相关内容供你参考：\n### 一、发展历史\n1. **古代阶段（公元前3世纪~19世纪）**：核心功能是文献保存，仅面向少数群体开放，代表有西方的亚历山大图书馆、中国古代的天一阁等各类官私藏书楼，主要功能是收藏、保管珍贵典籍，普通民众没有访问权限。\n2. **近代阶段（19世纪~20世纪末）**：现代公共图书馆制度逐步建立，核心转向知识普惠，面向全体公众开放，以纸质文献的借阅、流通为核心服务，承担公共文化传播、全民科普教育的职能。\n\n### 二、发展现状\n当前正处于数字化转型期，核心特征是「线上线下融合」：\n1. 资源端：纸质文献+数字资源并行，电子书、学术数据库、音视频资源占比持续提升，不少头部图书馆数字资源占比已超过纸质资源。\n2. 服务端：从单一借阅转向复合公共文化服务，除了传统借阅外，还承担公共自习空间、文化沙龙/展览、信息咨询、特殊人群无障碍服务等功能，是城市公共文化服务的核心节点。\n3. 体验端：智慧化服务普及，自助借还机、智能检索系统、线上移动端图书馆广泛应用，用户可以随时随地在线访问馆藏资源、预约线下服务。\n\n### 三、未来发展趋势\n1. **全面智慧化**：AI、大数据技术深度落地，实现精准资源推荐、智能咨询应答，根据用户需求主动提供定制化的知识服务。\n2. **场景多元化**：不仅有实体场馆，还会出现元宇宙虚拟图书馆、沉浸式阅读空间等新场景，同时会进一步下沉到社区、园区，成为分布式的公共文化服务触点。\n3. **功能复合化**：从「文献服务提供者」转向「终身学习服务支持者」，叠加创意孵化、文化传承、知识交流的功能，为创作者、研究者提供全链条的资源和空间支持。\n4. **资源开放共享**：跨区域、跨国家的图书馆资源互联互通机制逐步完善，进一步消除信息差，实现优质知识资源的普惠共享。", "client_message_id": "8c9ea3f4-4b66-4bb5-a3a2-113e50f40eff", "server_message_id": "c5777b76-fb4d-4ae4-8bfa-cf1595b3790f", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:41:59.982000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:42:00.038079+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "2bd886a1-9105-48e4-95cc-92c6ce350752", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀", "client_message_id": "f50c4fe8-3aa5-4b72-aad4-c05a89e57620", "server_message_id": "aebc5cd3-7d78-4b24-8929-5a39ecc2f1cb", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:42:48.832000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:42:53.416324+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "2bd886a1-9105-48e4-95cc-92c6ce350752", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好😊 我是你的专属Spark健康助手，如果你有饮食调理、运动建议、常见健康问题答疑、健康报告解读等健康相关的需求，都可以随时告诉我哦！", "client_message_id": "117573bc-22d8-44e6-af31-36c82ef8beb6", "server_message_id": "6bc2563f-dac6-4089-bda4-f01de6526c59", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:42:53.366000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:42:53.430335+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "2bd886a1-9105-48e4-95cc-92c6ce350752", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "什么什么", "client_message_id": "7ec6e3f9-f53b-44b9-9510-58bb891bdb83", "server_message_id": "a07cf416-a59f-40d5-bbbc-1d20d85f2fad", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:42:57.626000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:43:01.422852+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "2bd886a1-9105-48e4-95cc-92c6ce350752", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你是有什么健康相关的问题想要咨询吗？比如身体不适、饮食运动建议、常见健康知识科普、健康报告解读这类都可以告诉我，麻烦你详细说明一下你的需求哦~", "client_message_id": "77026096-93ea-43da-ae85-7aa79c032f4b", "server_message_id": "b2bd6418-d4f4-4501-9f49-bc34947ac26d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-05T03:43:01.389000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-05T03:43:01.432869+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
