INFO 2026-04-14 00:53:40,574 accounts.api_io [request_id=C372BB06-4F08-4E3A-8066-32D5AD3962F6] HTTP 响应摘要: GET /api/v1/ai/chat/sync/pull/ status=200 duration_ms=3 bytes=5255 headers={"Content-Type": "application/json", "Vary": "Accept", "Allow": "GET, HEAD, OPTIONS"} body={"code": 0, "msg": "ok", "data": {"cursor": "v2:eyJ0cyI6IjIwMjYtMDQtMDhUMDY6MDU6MTguOTc1OTM4KzAwOjAwIiwiaWQiOiI3NDIifQ", "messages": [{"thread_id": "4d05c999-ef65-469a-9443-ae8201a5d612", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "cfb5f467-c0a7-494e-acd0-5cfff81a2a2b", "server_message_id": "190dac6a-bb7f-4d34-acb6-fec924137e83", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:19.678000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:26.612039+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "4d05c999-ef65-469a-9443-ae8201a5d612", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好呀😊 我看到你提供了近期的用药和检查记录，请问你是有用药相关疑问、身体不适需要咨询，还是想了解这些药物的注意事项呢？可以把具体问题告诉我哦。", "client_message_id": "b4627daf-3728-44cb-817c-f8256f26ae55", "server_message_id": "de6746fd-f2d6-49db-b041-24f8db45a80b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:26.534000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:26.633225+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "4d05c999-ef65-469a-9443-ae8201a5d612", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你是谁", "client_message_id": "ca310306-8889-49a2-a530-97d0356d11bd", "server_message_id": "2bb64cf6-ae39-4a1f-b677-6bc13a37079e", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:32.733000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:37.597474+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "4d05c999-ef65-469a-9443-ae8201a5d612", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我是你的专属健康助手Spark✨ 可以帮你解读健康报告、解答用药疑问、提供健康生活建议，也能帮你记录和管理健康相关的信息。\n你有任何健康相关的问题都可以随时和我说~", "client_message_id": "9bb37b28-7479-40ec-a884-f1c04ca7463e", "server_message_id": "bbe7f190-d3db-451a-acec-a23d63740cb7", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:37.546000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:37.610799+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "4d05c999-ef65-469a-9443-ae8201a5d612", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "什么情况", "client_message_id": "cda92d82-6457-472f-abd9-8b1fc040bd2b", "server_message_id": "a88d1ae6-0e23-41f3-a2b7-de7f73e910d1", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:44.246000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:48.968881+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "4d05c999-ef65-469a-9443-ae8201a5d612", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "请问你是对之前提供的用药/检查记录有疑问，还是身体有不舒服的情况呀？可以具体描述下你的问题，我会尽力帮你解答😊", "client_message_id": "49372e44-948e-4669-95f7-e3578ee4c4af", "server_message_id": "d32863b6-bfcd-4a95-b886-43eae7ade872", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:48.927000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-08T06:04:48.978280+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "4d05c999-ef65-469a-9443-ae8201a5d612", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "什么情况", "client_message_id": "212ab9da-1ea3-425b-9acd-1148f5362f33", "server_message_id": "0b59d1b0-6dea-48fa-b009-0378b4486e6a", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-08T06:05:04.243000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-08T06:05:18.967781+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "4d05c999-ef65-469a-9443-ae8201a5d612", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "从你之前的健康记录来看，你近期的就诊相关情况是：\n1. 4月6日、4月8日分别做过相关检查\n2. 4月7日医生开具了三种药物：\n✅ 甲磺酸倍他司汀片：每次2片（12mg），每日3次，多用于改善眩晕、脑供血不足\n✅ 硫酸氢氯吡格雷片：每日1次，作用是抗血小板、预防血栓形成\n✅ 阿托伐他汀钙片：每晚1片（20mg），用于调节血脂、稳定血管斑块\n\n你是想了解这些药物的注意事项，还是关于病情、检查报告的相关问题呢？可以具体说下你的需求~", "client_message_id": "7061cc10-4bb5-44e3-8f55-563b60f0b5c6", "server_message_id": "47a59d06-4161-4ddc-b698-b808cd7d1753", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-08T06:05:18.930000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-08T06:05:18.975938+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
