 "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "8d8bc801-06c8-4402-89b3-40daeaa89ff2", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "你好", "client_message_id": "4559340e-f625-4ae0-9c25-ec21c82fb4a8", "server_message_id": "5aa6be6a-0b72-42cf-8553-cf68ccc9c8a5", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T02:22:11.496000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T02:22:14.666293+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "8d8bc801-06c8-4402-89b3-40daeaa89ff2", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "你好！很高兴见到你 👋\n\n我是你的**Spark健康助手**，可以帮你处理各种健康相关的事务：\n\n🔍 **健康数据分析** - 步数、睡眠、能量消耗、运动记录等  \n📋 **报告解读** - 体检报告、病历、检验单等  \n💊 **用药管理** - 记录用药、设置提醒  \n📅 **日程管理** - 预约提醒、复查提醒  \n📚 **健康知识** - 疾病知识、健康科普  \n📍 **位置服务** - 附近医院、药店查询\n\n**今天有什么我可以帮你的吗？** 比如查看最近的体检报告、分析运动数据，或者设置用药提醒？", "client_message_id": "6324f965-029e-46b7-b77b-28eb5c823b6e", "server_message_id": "05c6b64a-2ad6-4db1-8138-cb62146ae7be", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T02:22:24.485000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T02:22:24.519087+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}], "has_more": false}}
