t": "2026-04-13T03:58:15.445000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T03:58:19.985506+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "ea36a61d-b6c7-436d-895f-45d20e062655", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "我的意思是：我已经帮您创建了一个关于「计算机知识」的学习知识库，里面整理了以下核心内容：\n\n| 模块 | 主要内容 |\n|------|---------|\n| 🖥️ 硬件与系统 | CPU、内存、操作系统基础 |\n| 💻 编程语言 | Python/Java/C++等应用场景 |\n| 🔧 算法数据结构 | 排序、查找、树、图等 |\n| 🗄️ 数据库 | MySQL、MongoDB 等 |\n| 🌐 网络基础 | HTTP、TCP/IP、OSI模型 |\n| ⚙️ 开发模式 | MVC、微服务、设计模式 |\n| 🤖 前沿技术 | AI、云计算、大数据方向 |\n\n**您可以这样使用：**\n- ✅ **补充知识点**：如\"添加Python深度学习入门\"\n- ✅ **检索回顾**：随时问\"查一下机器学习基础\"\n- ✅ **整理路径**：让我帮您规划学习路线\n\n需要我详细说明某个部分，或者帮您规划学习顺序吗？", "client_message_id": "95c4c32b-8525-4e1c-b902-7825a8add010", "server_message_id": "d188bc4f-caa4-4af6-b4ca-8493b98d2b20", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:58:19.941000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T03:58:19.993418+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "ea36a61d-b6c7-436d-895f-45d20e062655", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "创建网络知识的 知识库", "client_message_id": "bd2b52e8-4da0-45f5-b252-ffe7ad62d49f", "server_message_id": "0b692a1d-8fd4-44f0-b544-58d9adaecc69", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T03:59:05.454000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T03:59:19.173875+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "ea36a61d-b6c7-436d-895f-45d20e062655", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "✅ 已成功创建「网络知识」知识库！\n\n文档涵盖以下核心内容：\n- 🌐 **OSI七层模型**与TCP/IP协议栈详解\n- 🔢 **IP地址与子网划分**（IPv4/IPv6）\n- 📡 **常见网络设备**功能对比（交换机/路由器等）\n- 🌍 **DNS域名系统**解析机制\n- 📡 **HTTP/HTTPS协议**详解（请求方法/状态码）\n-