 📄 我已经为您创建了：\n  - 《浏览器历史与隐私管理》\n  - 《电脑基础知识》\n\n这些文档已经保存在我的**本地知识背包**中了，您可以随时让我检索或更新它们。\n\n如果您想：\n- 🔍 **查看/搜索**现有文档内容 → 我可以帮您检索\n- ✏️ **修改/补充**某份文档 → 我可以编辑\n- 📚 **创建新主题**的知识库 → 请告诉我主题\n\n另外，您之前提到的\"保存到只知识库\"是不是想说\"**本地知识库**\"呢？如果是的话，文档已经保存在里面了哦！\n\n有什么具体需求吗？😊", "client_message_id": "d9556db2-28bb-4f97-8f47-945c0a06c7cd", "server_message_id": "9859a33d-cae5-4e92-a1ff-5147710c431b", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T04:10:25.805000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T04:10:25.826356+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "12179055-31e7-42ef-98ec-8826b2e2d2e2", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "我附近的咖啡厅", "client_message_id": "1bb7d14c-aa46-4c86-9a38-ddd3613f8b9e", "server_message_id": "b16c40eb-9d57-4a93-b0f7-8c2ab839a7be", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T04:12:20.178000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T04:12:25.794916+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "12179055-31e7-42ef-98ec-8826b2e2d2e2", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "📍 **关于附近咖啡厅**\n\n目前我无法自动获取您的实时位置（系统需要额外的位置服务配置）。不过我们可以这样解决：\n\n### 🌟 两种快速方案：\n1️⃣ **告诉我您所在的城市/区域**  \n   （例如：\"我在苏州独墅湖\"、\"上海静安寺附近\"）  \n   → 我会立即为您搜索周边咖啡厅！\n\n2️⃣ **手动开启定位权限后重试**  \n   （如果您在支持定位的设备上）  \n   → 我就能精准推荐最近的咖啡馆啦～\n\n---\n\n💡 **小贴士**：  \n- 如果您喜欢安静环境，可以特别说明  \n- 需要带Wi-Fi/适合办公的咖啡厅吗？  \n- 对咖啡类型有偏好吗（美式/拿铁/手冲）？\n\n请告诉我您的位置或需求，马上帮您规划！☕😊", "client_message_id": "8fd0cbf3-32a5-4b0f-8834-2381c01b3a3c", "server_message_id": "85fbe78a-2201-4ec8-a273-20faabb0bf8d", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T04:12:25.768000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T04:12:25.805392+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "12179055-31e7-42ef-98ec-8826b2e2d2e2", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "创建咖啡知识库", "client_message_id": "fa966b23-19fb-45bd-a15a-d0e4c33c5766", "server_message_id": "af1720f7-7d9a-4a61-ad81-0a7619b6badc", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T04:14:03.026000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T04:14:12.016639+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "12179055-31e7-42ef-98ec-8826b2e2d2e2", "role": "assistant", "kind": "text", "content": "✅ 已成功为您创建知识文档 **《咖啡知识与健康指南》**！\n\n---\n\n📚 **文档内容概览：**\n\n| 章节 | 主题 | 内容亮点 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| ☕ **基础篇** | 咖啡种类 | 意式/美式/手冲/冷萃等区别 |\n| 🌍 **产地篇** | 世界产区 | 阿拉比卡vs罗布斯塔、主要产国 |\n| 🔥 **冲泡篇** | 家庭制作 | 滴滤/法压/浓缩/摩卡壶详解 |\n| ❤️ **健康篇** | 功效与禁忌 | 抗氧化、提神、咖啡因耐受量 |\n| ⚠️ **注意篇** | 饮用建议 | 空腹/失眠/孕妇注意事项 |\n\n---\n\n### 💡 这份文档可以帮您：\n- 了解不同咖啡的风味特点\n- 学习正确的冲泡技巧\n- 掌握健康饮用方式\n- 避免咖啡因过量摄入\n\n---\n\n**后续操作：**\n- 🔍 需要我检索这份文档中的具体信息吗？\n- ✏️ 想补充特定主题（如拉花技巧/咖啡豆选购）？\n- 🎯 或者创建其他健康/生活类知识库？\n\n随时告诉我！😊", "client_message_id": "44ef5f1e-3db4-4be7-bf40-664630686628", "server_message_id": "20065e5c-2108-4ee5-bf65-79b6b69e5e69", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T04:14:11.995000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T04:14:12.026543+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}, {"thread_id": "12179055-31e7-42ef-98ec-8826b2e2d2e2", "role": "user", "kind": "text", "content": "进行保存", "client_message_id": "2f6b7714-cd55-4dce-8bf8-76043bc41bf9", "server_message_id": "7253e105-ed68-464b-a568-3605e1df4ce7", "delivery_state": "sent", "created_at": "2026-04-13T04:14:31.149000+00:00", "server_updated_at": "2026-04-13T04:14:34.295047+00:00", "tombstone": false, "attachments": [], "reasoning_content": null, "re